    ("Kuohu korwien tasalle,", "Kuohui korvien tasalle,", "kuohua, korva, tasalle", "to foam/boil over, ear, level with", "It foamed level with the ears,", "The beer's dramatic, overflowing fermentation — foaming up to the brim, threatening to spill onto the floor — gives the brew an almost willful, animated character, as though the magic itself is straining for release, fitting the broader pattern of the epic's inanimate or half-animate objects (the bleeding comb, the singing hop-vine) acting with apparent agency."),
